[00:00.90] (Leon Payne)
[00:09.14] I love you because you understand, dear
[00:16.04] Every single thing I try to do
[00:24.02] You're always there to lend a helping hand, dear
[00:31.84] I love you most of all because you're you.
[00:39.14] No matter what the world may say about me
[00:46.90] I know your love will always see me through
[00:54.68] I love you for the way you never doubt me
[01:03.20] But most of all I love you 'cause you're you.
[01:27.16] --- Instrumental ---
[01:27.16] I love you because my heart is lighter
[01:34.58] Every time I'm walking by your side
[01:41.34] I love you because my future's brighter
[01:49.88] The door to happiness you've opened wide.
[01:58.02] No matter what may be the style or seasons
[02:04.54] I know your heart will always be true
[02:12.76] I love you for a hundred thousand reasons
[02:20.72] But most of all I love you because you're you...
